### 用户 API 测试用例

### 获取所有用户
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### 创建新用户
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test_user",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "age": 25,
  "status": "active",
  "role": "user"
}

### 根据ID获取用户
GET http://localhost:3000/users/用户ID

### 根据用户名获取用户
GET http://localhost:3000/users/username/admin

### 根据状态获取用户列表
GET http://localhost:3000/users/status/active

### 根据角色获取用户列表
GET http://localhost:3000/users/role/user

### 更新用户信息
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/用户ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 26,
  "status": "inactive"
}

### 删除用户
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/用户ID

### 产品 API 测试用例

### 获取所有产品
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### 创建新产品
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试产品",
  "description": "这是一个测试产品",
  "price": 99.99,
  "stock": 100,
  "category": "other",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/test-product.jpg",
  "tags": ["测试", "产品"],
  "status": "available",
  "rating": 4.5,
  "salesCount": 0
}

### 根据ID获取产品
GET http://localhost:3000/products/产品ID

### 根据名称搜索产品
GET http://localhost:3000/products/search/iPhone

### 根据分类获取产品列表
GET http://localhost:3000/products/category/electronics

### 根据状态获取产品列表
GET http://localhost:3000/products/status/available

### 根据价格范围获取产品列表
GET http://localhost:3000/products/price-range?minPrice=100&maxPrice=1000

### 获取低库存产品
GET http://localhost:3000/products/low-stock/list

### 获取热门产品
GET http://localhost:3000/products/popular/list?limit=5

### 更新产品信息
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/产品ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 89.99,
  "stock": 80
}

### 增加产品库存
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/产品ID/increase-stock?quantity=20

### 减少产品库存
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/产品ID/decrease-stock?quantity=5

### 删除产品
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/产品ID

### API 文档
GET http://localhost:3000/api